1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Hey!

2
00:00:03,639 --> 00:00:05,879
I'm hurt, damn it.
I thought we agreed on meeting, you little shit.

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:09,480
We did! I'm normally the first one.
You're always like this.

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:15,679
Me? Alright, enough.
What's up? What's going on?

5
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:21,439
Hey—P'In invited us to drink tonight.
You guys in?

6
00:00:21,439 --> 00:00:25,400
I'm in.
I'm going anyway.

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:30,160
I don't feel well. Yeah right, don't make shit up.
Your face shows you're fine.

8
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:34,600
God, every time…
I just recovered for real this time.

9
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:39,719
Exactly. You're recovered, so you can come with us.
You're fine now, right? Come on.

10
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:44,039
Yeah, you're fine, so you can come!
You're good to go.

11
00:00:44,039 --> 00:00:48,120
Yeah yeah—he's fine. He's coming.

12
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:50,668
Well? What's your answer?

13
00:00:52,253 --> 00:00:54,601
If Tawan goes, I'll go.

14
00:00:54,744 --> 00:00:57,224
Okay then, it's settled.
You…

15
00:00:57,224 --> 00:01:02,559
So you *have* to go.
You said it, Tawan.

16
00:01:02,559 --> 00:01:04,640
Alright, fine.
We'll see.

17
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:09,479
Damn… I don't know—
fucking motorbike racer.

18
00:01:09,479 --> 00:01:12,159
Come on!
Eat up!

19
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:13,240
Yeah!

20
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:21,200
Alright, let's go!
Let's keep dancing!

21
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:24,510
The music got quiet.
Yeah, screw it.

22
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:29,320
Dude, you're not dancing?

23
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:33,240
Yo guys, I need to take this call—don't pause the game.

24
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,720
Alright, hurry back.
What's wrong with you?

25
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:39,159
Yeah yeah, I'll be right back.
Be right back—be right back—

26
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:45,730
Okay—

27
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,380
You sure eat a lot.
